WEBVTT

01:14.060 --> 01:18.340
[Meet Yourself]

01:19.300 --> 01:23.940
[Episode 06]

02:00.358 --> 02:03.958
Hello,
the subscriber you dialed is powered off.

02:20.473 --> 02:21.473
Come on, cheers.

02:21.473 --> 02:22.913
Cheers.

02:29.953 --> 02:30.953
Yuan.

02:31.553 --> 02:32.793
These are all my friends.

02:32.793 --> 02:33.992
I'm introducing all of them to you.

02:33.993 --> 02:35.472
From now on,
they're also your friends.

02:35.473 --> 02:36.473
Are you happy?

02:37.593 --> 02:40.032
This is my little brother,
Yuan, Xie Zhiyuan.

02:40.033 --> 02:41.393
Take him to play with you.

02:41.713 --> 02:42.393
Yuan, hello.

02:42.393 --> 02:43.393
Hello.

02:43.593 --> 02:44.593
Hello.

02:44.873 --> 02:45.353
Yuan.

02:45.353 --> 02:46.673
Do you know how to play morra?

02:48.593 --> 02:49.592
No.

02:49.593 --> 02:50.593
You don't know?

02:50.793 --> 02:51.952
You guys play first.

02:51.953 --> 02:52.992
OK, fine.

02:52.993 --> 02:54.633
I'll play with whoever loses.

02:54.633 --> 02:56.153
Why don't you look happy?

02:57.553 --> 02:58.673
Have some drinks.

02:59.953 --> 03:02.993
My brother said I had to wait
until the age of 18 to drink.

03:04.873 --> 03:07.472
Kiddo,
you're still listening to your brother?

03:07.473 --> 03:10.272
You need to be a man,
be yourself, and be independent,

03:10.273 --> 03:11.273
you know?

03:11.713 --> 03:12.713
Independent.

03:13.833 --> 03:14.913
How to be independent?

03:15.353 --> 03:16.353
Well,

03:17.553 --> 03:20.032
being independent means you
can make money on your own.

03:20.033 --> 03:21.792
Don't you hate to be always
disciplined by your brother?

03:21.793 --> 03:23.193
That's because you're not making any money

03:23.193 --> 03:24.672
so you don't have confidence.

03:24.673 --> 03:25.672
Once you start to make money,

03:25.673 --> 03:28.992
you can straighten up your
back and do whatever you want.

03:28.993 --> 03:30.593
You'll be assertive.

03:31.353 --> 03:32.353
Assertive?

03:33.033 --> 03:33.929
Yes.

03:33.953 --> 03:35.233
I have to be assertive.

03:42.113 --> 03:44.393
I think my brother's right.

03:48.273 --> 03:49.552
Can you drink coconut milk?

03:49.553 --> 03:50.553
Sure.

03:52.113 --> 03:54.352
Ma'am,
a bottle of coconut milk, please.

03:54.353 --> 03:55.353
OK.

03:56.913 --> 03:59.352
Anyway, look on the bright side.

03:59.353 --> 04:00.993
Now you are free.

04:01.673 --> 04:04.673
Get a feel of what
it's like to be free.

04:08.833 --> 04:09.753
Come on, finish your drinks.

04:09.753 --> 04:10.793
Come on.

04:11.193 --> 04:12.993
Cheers. Cheers.

04:13.913 --> 04:15.633
Why did you run away from home?

04:17.193 --> 04:19.593
I became famous in my hometown.

04:20.953 --> 04:22.633
Give me 75 yuan each.

04:32.273 --> 04:33.033
You don't need to pay.

04:33.033 --> 04:33.912
It's my treat.

04:33.913 --> 04:35.352
No, I have to.

04:35.353 --> 04:35.793
Just enough money.

04:35.793 --> 04:36.912
You don't need to.

04:36.913 --> 04:37.913
Take it.

04:40.473 --> 04:42.352
Let's call it a day and get
together again sometime.

04:42.353 --> 04:43.032
OK.

04:43.033 --> 04:43.952
Bye-bye.

04:43.953 --> 04:45.593
Bye-bye, Yuan.

04:46.793 --> 04:47.793
Bye-bye.

04:51.753 --> 04:52.753
What's wrong?

04:53.353 --> 04:54.353
Feeling homesick?

04:55.353 --> 04:57.032
That's what happens when you first left home.

04:57.033 --> 04:58.352
Remember.

04:58.353 --> 04:59.353
Be independent.

05:00.153 --> 05:01.153
Let's go.

05:02.913 --> 05:03.913
Be independent.

05:13.633 --> 05:14.592
I have to be independent.

05:14.593 --> 05:15.712
I need to get a job and make money.

05:15.713 --> 05:16.793
I'm going to piss Xie Zhiyao off.

05:16.793 --> 05:17.553
Piss Xie Zhiyao off.

05:17.553 --> 05:18.312
Exactly.

05:18.313 --> 05:19.432
He kicked my butt.

05:19.433 --> 05:20.352
He gave me the cold shoulder.

05:20.353 --> 05:21.432
He ignored me.

05:21.433 --> 05:22.233
I'll make him so worried.

05:22.233 --> 05:22.913
Make him so worried.

05:22.913 --> 05:24.233
Yes, make him so worried.

05:25.473 --> 05:26.409
Liang.

05:26.433 --> 05:27.392
I've made a decision.

05:27.393 --> 05:31.313
Starting today, I, Xie Zhiyuan,
will get myself a job.

05:31.313 --> 05:34.193
Just follow me
and get a job to do.

05:34.193 --> 05:35.072
OK.

05:35.073 --> 05:37.433
Let me teach you how to say "welcome" first.

05:37.873 --> 05:39.073
You have to be passionate.

05:39.073 --> 05:39.473
Passionate.

05:39.473 --> 05:41.273
The guests might not feel
anything when they hear it,

05:41.273 --> 05:42.473
but if the boss sees how passionate we are,

05:42.473 --> 05:43.073
he'll feel happy.

05:43.073 --> 05:43.792
Happy?

05:43.793 --> 05:44.033
That's right.

05:44.033 --> 05:45.393
Liang, how do we say it?

05:48.193 --> 05:50.033
Welcome.

05:50.513 --> 05:52.032
Welcome.

05:52.033 --> 05:53.873
You need to let out your breath.

05:53.873 --> 05:55.872
Welcome.

05:55.873 --> 05:56.393
You, you...

05:56.393 --> 05:57.833
Notice the rhythm.

05:57.833 --> 05:59.913
Welcome.

05:59.913 --> 06:02.153
Be enthusiastic and brave.

06:06.673 --> 06:09.312
♫ Be brave ♫

06:09.313 --> 06:12.472
♫ Darkness ♫

06:12.473 --> 06:15.392
♫ is only ♫

06:15.393 --> 06:17.992
♫ our conjecture ♫

06:17.993 --> 06:20.873
♫ The twists and turns ♫

06:20.873 --> 06:23.632
♫ in life ♫

06:23.633 --> 06:25.993
♫ make me ♫

06:34.673 --> 06:35.993
Have you found Yuan?

06:36.273 --> 06:37.192
No.

06:37.193 --> 06:39.033
He ran away from home,
took his bag with him,

06:39.033 --> 06:40.873
and a change of clothes.

06:42.073 --> 06:43.593
I really didn't say that.

06:44.233 --> 06:45.512
This isn't important.

06:45.513 --> 06:46.192
No.

06:46.193 --> 06:47.873
This is extremely important.

06:48.193 --> 06:49.473
I didn't say it.

06:51.673 --> 06:52.752
I swear.

06:52.753 --> 06:54.833
I've never even talked in my sleep.

06:56.873 --> 06:58.112
I'll just have to take your word for it.

06:58.113 --> 07:00.112
What do you mean by "have to"?

07:00.113 --> 07:01.713
I just didn't say it.

07:02.233 --> 07:03.832
OK, fine.

07:03.833 --> 07:07.193
"OK" means OK,
but "fine" means you don't believe me,

07:07.193 --> 07:08.832
and you're giving me the runaround, right?

07:08.833 --> 07:09.913
Calm down first.

07:09.913 --> 07:11.232
I didn't mean anything else.

07:11.233 --> 07:11.553
No.

07:11.553 --> 07:14.393
You can't get me wrong like this.

07:15.113 --> 07:16.953
The point is just the two of us

07:16.953 --> 07:18.672
know about this in the village.

07:18.673 --> 07:21.152
Just the two of us know
about this in the village.

07:21.153 --> 07:22.312
I didn't say it.

07:22.313 --> 07:24.233
So is it possible that you said it?

07:24.753 --> 07:26.433
You keep interrupting me,
and I'm fine with it.

07:26.433 --> 07:28.073
I didn't get you wrong,
and now you're getting me wrong?

07:28.073 --> 07:29.273
Of course, I didn't say that.

07:29.273 --> 07:31.833
If one of us let the word out,

07:32.833 --> 07:33.873
it's certainly not me.

07:34.193 --> 07:35.513
It's not me, either.

07:40.153 --> 07:41.033
This doesn't matter.

07:41.033 --> 07:42.392
It matters very much.

07:42.393 --> 07:44.473
The priority now is to find your brother.

07:52.553 --> 07:53.993
What are you laughing at?

07:56.393 --> 07:57.713
You're so kind.

08:01.953 --> 08:03.273
Weirdo.

08:11.393 --> 08:13.432
I sent Guobao to kindergarten,

08:13.433 --> 08:14.993
and ran into him at the mouth of the alley.

08:15.273 --> 08:16.953
I just wanted to make a joke

08:17.193 --> 08:18.633
and asked him if it was true
that he didn't go to school

08:18.633 --> 08:19.833
because he crapped his pants.

08:20.233 --> 08:21.433
And he ran away.

08:27.873 --> 08:29.273
Me... Me too.

08:29.993 --> 08:33.553
Today he called me to
ask for Hongdou's number.

08:34.033 --> 08:37.233
I just made a joke
and asked him.

08:37.993 --> 08:39.833
And who did you hear it from?

08:40.193 --> 08:41.633
From my mom.

08:42.073 --> 08:46.112
All the grannies in the
warehouse knew about it.

08:46.113 --> 08:49.073
I guess Aunt E heard it from them,
too.

08:49.673 --> 08:52.592
So now we can't
find who started it.

08:52.593 --> 08:53.952
Why do you want to find it?

08:53.953 --> 08:55.392
This doesn't matter.

08:55.393 --> 08:56.513
It matters.

08:56.753 --> 08:58.753
She didn't say it,
and I didn't say it.

08:58.993 --> 09:00.352
Then who got the word out?

09:00.353 --> 09:02.552
Now you're still caring about
who got the word out?

09:02.553 --> 09:04.072
Why don't you go look for Yuan first?

09:04.073 --> 09:05.153
It's all because of you.

09:05.393 --> 09:06.752
You made a joke.

09:06.753 --> 09:08.153
Can you make a joke about it?

09:08.793 --> 09:10.273
He's just a kid.

09:11.473 --> 09:12.872
16 or 17 is the age

09:12.873 --> 09:15.033
when people's self-esteem is at its highest.

09:15.313 --> 09:17.473
No matter how young he is,
you can't make a joke

09:17.473 --> 09:18.833
about his shameful secret.

09:24.233 --> 09:25.792
You guys don't know

09:25.793 --> 09:27.393
when Yang Guanjun was in junior high school,

09:27.393 --> 09:29.032
he went swimming in the reservoir,

09:29.033 --> 09:31.273
and his classmates hid his clothes.

09:31.273 --> 09:33.992
When it was dark,
he went back to the village naked.

09:33.993 --> 09:35.353
The nannies in the village
thought he was a pervert,

09:35.353 --> 09:37.432
and almost beat him up.

09:37.433 --> 09:38.992
It's all in the past. Why did you spill it out?

09:38.993 --> 09:40.473
I was just making a joke.

09:44.033 --> 09:45.033
Well,

09:45.593 --> 09:46.593
Yao.

09:47.073 --> 09:50.393
Do you think Yuan would
go back to Kunming?

09:50.953 --> 09:53.592
That's why he came from Kunming.

09:53.593 --> 09:54.552
How could he go back?

09:54.553 --> 09:55.752
Did you ask Uncle Siping?

09:55.753 --> 09:56.793
I did.

09:58.393 --> 10:00.393
I don't think you're anxious at all.

10:02.593 --> 10:04.392
Why would I be anxious?

10:04.393 --> 10:07.552
He's grown up and has
some money in his pocket.

10:07.553 --> 10:08.912
I may as well let him go.

10:08.913 --> 10:11.393
When he runs out of money,
he'll come back himself.

10:12.473 --> 10:14.313
You have such a big heart.

10:14.873 --> 10:17.232
What if he steals and robs
things when he runs out of money?

10:17.233 --> 10:19.073
Then the law will punish him.

10:25.793 --> 10:26.793
Xie Xiaoxia.

10:28.233 --> 10:30.953
You're close to him.

10:31.913 --> 10:33.753
Didn't he tell you where he went?

10:36.593 --> 10:37.593
No.

10:40.593 --> 10:42.433
He asked you to say that, right?

10:43.273 --> 10:43.713
No, Yao.

10:43.713 --> 10:44.793
I really don't know.

10:50.313 --> 10:52.193
It's so much trouble to raise a child.

10:55.833 --> 10:57.913
Why are the four kids
behaving so well today?

11:22.433 --> 11:23.433
Take another bite.

11:24.313 --> 11:25.873
We can't buy it here.

11:27.153 --> 11:28.153
Come on.

11:30.513 --> 11:31.353
He said something?

11:31.353 --> 11:32.433
What did he say?

11:34.713 --> 11:36.793
He said he bought two tangerines

11:37.073 --> 11:38.353
but they didn't taste sweet.

11:38.753 --> 11:40.073
We sell a lot of tangerines.

11:40.073 --> 11:42.113
How can we peel all of them
and taste if they're sweet,

11:42.113 --> 11:42.992
right?

11:42.993 --> 11:43.993
Yes.

11:45.113 --> 11:47.673
Back then,
only the emperor in the palace

11:47.673 --> 11:50.032
had this treatment.

11:50.033 --> 11:52.833
No matter what he ate,
he'd ask the maid to taste it first

11:53.153 --> 11:54.193
in case it was poisonous.

11:54.593 --> 11:56.953
The emperor had the
remains of the maid's food?

11:57.673 --> 11:59.873
Now that I think about it,
it seems you're right.

12:02.473 --> 12:03.713
It's spoiled.

12:04.193 --> 12:05.032
Chuchu.

12:05.033 --> 12:05.912
Come and have a look.

12:05.913 --> 12:07.632
See if the tangerines
are bought from us.

12:07.633 --> 12:08.872
He said three of them are spoiled.

12:08.873 --> 12:10.392
How could we tell?

12:10.393 --> 12:11.993
We couldn't tell.

12:14.033 --> 12:15.393
Aunt Gui, there you are again.

12:15.393 --> 12:17.112
I came to chat with Auntie Feng.

12:17.113 --> 12:18.993
We are now at work time.

12:18.993 --> 12:21.033
I won't affect her work.

12:21.833 --> 12:22.592
Manager.

12:22.593 --> 12:23.432
Come and look at this.

12:23.433 --> 12:24.433
Chuchu.

12:25.073 --> 12:26.073
The comment says

12:26.673 --> 12:27.553
three of the tangerines are spoiled.

12:27.553 --> 12:29.273
Do you think he bought these from us?

12:29.553 --> 12:30.992
Aren't they oranges?

12:30.993 --> 12:32.473
I thought so.

12:32.793 --> 12:34.313
And he asked for compensation.

12:35.553 --> 12:36.312
Compensate them.

12:36.313 --> 12:37.352
No.

12:37.353 --> 12:38.192
Auntie Feng.

12:38.193 --> 12:39.473
Just let it go.

12:39.473 --> 12:41.712
If it's hard to explain,
we compensate them.

12:41.713 --> 12:42.833
But it's way out of line.

12:42.833 --> 12:44.112
How could he do this?

12:44.113 --> 12:45.872
Auntie Feng, let me tell you.

12:45.873 --> 12:48.673
If you say that to him,
he'll give us a bad review

12:48.673 --> 12:50.352
and it won't do any good to our business.

12:50.353 --> 12:51.353
Understand?

12:52.033 --> 12:53.033
Understood.

12:53.473 --> 12:54.473
It's fine.

12:55.873 --> 12:56.752
Manager.

12:56.753 --> 12:58.232
Have you found Yuan?

12:58.233 --> 12:59.233
No.

12:59.353 --> 13:01.033
It's been days.

13:01.473 --> 13:03.273
Mr. Xie said he's
got money with him

13:03.273 --> 13:04.273
so there's no need to worry.

13:05.713 --> 13:07.193
This is a wrong idea.

13:07.753 --> 13:09.593
Why didn't Yao go to find his brother?

13:10.313 --> 13:13.913
Kids of his age can't
tell right from wrong.

13:14.433 --> 13:17.153
If he hangs out with some bad guys,

13:17.433 --> 13:18.553
he'll be finished.

13:19.393 --> 13:22.952
They'll do petty thieving in the beginning,
and then

13:22.953 --> 13:24.513
start to rob.

13:29.033 --> 13:29.993
How come?

13:29.993 --> 13:31.393
Why not?

13:32.953 --> 13:35.793
He should have spanked
him when he skipped school.

13:36.273 --> 13:37.313
It's good now.

13:37.793 --> 13:39.193
His dad couldn't bear to spank him

13:39.193 --> 13:40.352
and sent him back to their hometown.

13:40.353 --> 13:43.473
And his brother just stood
by and let him do anything?

13:43.713 --> 13:45.633
I mean get him back first.

13:45.633 --> 13:49.272
And if he still doesn't behave,
just break his legs

13:49.273 --> 13:50.992
and see if he'll listen to the adults.

13:50.993 --> 13:52.312
Alright, alright.

13:52.313 --> 13:53.272
Aunt Gui.

13:53.273 --> 13:56.432
Well,
could you help us clean the yams?

13:56.433 --> 13:58.352
I'm here to have fun,
not to work.

13:58.353 --> 13:59.353
You have experience.

13:59.353 --> 14:00.833
Come on, put on the gloves.

14:01.913 --> 14:03.073
OK, OK.

14:34.673 --> 14:35.552
Hello.

14:35.553 --> 14:37.953
I've been waiting a long
time for my boletus pancakes.

14:38.553 --> 14:39.153
I'm sorry.

14:39.153 --> 14:40.193
We get a lot of customers today.

14:40.193 --> 14:41.392
Please wait a minute.

14:41.393 --> 14:41.993
All right.

14:41.993 --> 14:42.832
Please hurry.

14:42.833 --> 14:43.833
OK.

14:48.753 --> 14:49.752
Let me help you.

14:49.753 --> 14:50.753
Which table?

14:51.913 --> 14:53.432
In the end tearoom.

14:53.433 --> 14:54.593
Thanks.

14:58.073 --> 14:59.073
Nana.

14:59.153 --> 15:00.153
Mr. Xie.

15:02.233 --> 15:04.233
Why is Xu Hongdou serving dishes?

15:04.753 --> 15:05.793
She's here to have a drink.

15:05.793 --> 15:07.713
She saw I'm busy
so she wanted to help.

15:09.433 --> 15:10.873
Are these the new books you just bought?

15:11.233 --> 15:12.032
Yes.

15:12.033 --> 15:12.673
It's too heavy.

15:12.673 --> 15:13.513
I was afraid you wouldn't be able to move them,

15:13.513 --> 15:14.753
so I took them there for you.

15:15.273 --> 15:16.273
I'll put them in storage first.

15:16.273 --> 15:17.592
Remember to unpack them.

15:17.593 --> 15:18.593
Great.

15:20.193 --> 15:24.633
♫ There are breezes in some parts of the world ♫

15:25.313 --> 15:27.873
♫ and some touching moments ♫

15:29.913 --> 15:32.953
♫ Whose dream will be fulfilled ♫

15:35.153 --> 15:36.153
Nana.

15:37.113 --> 15:40.712
Another latte and boletus
pancake for table 2.

15:40.713 --> 15:42.272
Do you have freebies?

15:42.273 --> 15:43.112
Freebies?

15:43.113 --> 15:44.433
The guests at that table
have been waiting for a long time.

15:44.433 --> 15:45.712
They have already drunk two glasses of water.

15:45.713 --> 15:47.953
Do you have some canapes for them to eat?

15:49.073 --> 15:51.592
I've got some nuts
and Mahjong cookies.

15:51.593 --> 15:52.032
OK.

15:52.033 --> 15:55.833
♫ Although the seasons go by ♫

15:56.593 --> 16:00.153
♫ I still love them as when I was young ♫

16:00.393 --> 16:04.233
♫ Sometimes I find I fall in love ♫

16:05.193 --> 16:08.953
♫ Make a little wish and pray ♫

16:09.593 --> 16:13.393
♫ Maybe things will go your way ♫

16:13.393 --> 16:14.073
Sorry.

16:14.073 --> 16:15.592
We're a bit busy today.

16:15.593 --> 16:17.113
These are the freshly
baked Mahjong cookies.

16:17.113 --> 16:18.152
Please have a taste.

16:18.153 --> 16:19.153
Thank you.

16:23.113 --> 16:23.952
Enjoy.

16:23.953 --> 16:24.953
Thanks.

16:26.193 --> 16:30.393
♫ Flowers bloom in the wind ♫

16:30.913 --> 16:33.553
♫ Twilight awakens the stars ♫

16:35.593 --> 16:38.833
♫ Those are the good times ♫

16:40.913 --> 16:42.512
Two oranges and two pears,
right?

16:42.513 --> 16:43.513
Yes.

16:45.593 --> 16:52.473
♫ Say goodbye to the passing time ♫

16:53.873 --> 16:54.873
How to use this?

16:56.113 --> 16:57.153
This is very simple.

16:57.153 --> 16:58.393
After the start button lights up,

16:58.393 --> 17:01.272
push the round button here,
and choose juice,

17:01.273 --> 17:03.033
and then press the
start button again.

17:03.033 --> 17:05.833
♫ As when I was young ♫

17:06.113 --> 17:10.153
♫ Sometimes I find I fall in love ♫

17:11.113 --> 17:14.672
♫ Make a little wish and pray ♫

17:14.673 --> 17:15.632
Nana.

17:15.633 --> 17:16.633
I've put them there.

17:18.793 --> 17:19.953
Have you found Yuan?

17:20.273 --> 17:20.993
Not yet.

17:20.993 --> 17:21.912
It's only been a few days.

17:21.913 --> 17:22.913
Don't worry.

17:23.593 --> 17:24.432
Right.

17:24.433 --> 17:25.753
It's your brother, not mine.

17:25.753 --> 17:26.753
Why should I be worried?

17:28.633 --> 17:32.113
A lobby manager knows
how to serve dishes?

17:32.353 --> 17:34.672
The job of the lobby manager
is to provide good service.

17:34.673 --> 17:35.713
I have to learn to do everything.

17:37.393 --> 17:40.033
I thought all you need to do is
to manage your subordinates.

17:40.513 --> 17:41.593
I need to manage everything.

17:42.713 --> 17:44.193
You're good at managing things.

17:50.673 --> 17:51.392
Alright.

17:51.393 --> 17:51.793
You get busy.

17:51.793 --> 17:52.793
I gotta go.

17:55.273 --> 17:57.153
Mr. Xie, the light bulbs.

17:57.433 --> 17:58.433
I know.

18:01.073 --> 18:02.073
I got this.

18:02.473 --> 18:03.073
Let me serve this first.

18:03.073 --> 18:04.073
OK.

18:11.513 --> 18:12.392
Thank you.

18:12.393 --> 18:14.112
Thank you so much today.

18:14.113 --> 18:15.592
This is one of our drinks, Encounter.

18:15.593 --> 18:16.593
Have a try.

18:18.433 --> 18:19.433
It's ice.

18:19.753 --> 18:20.713
It's so pretty.

18:20.713 --> 18:23.153
Dark red roses taste completely
different when cold brewed

18:23.153 --> 18:24.753
and brewed with boiling water.

18:33.258 --> 18:35.298
Tastes like fresh roses.

18:35.833 --> 18:36.672
Right?

18:36.673 --> 18:39.313
I think it's a taste
of taking our time.

18:39.913 --> 18:41.153
Take our time?

18:41.633 --> 18:42.833
The taste of taking our time

18:42.833 --> 18:45.953
needs a very important condiment,
which is time.

18:48.913 --> 18:51.153
Now in the world,
fewer and fewer things

18:51.153 --> 18:52.152
know how to take their time.

18:52.153 --> 18:53.913
Everything is in a hurry,

18:54.833 --> 18:56.633
and people are treated as machines.

18:58.273 --> 18:59.273
Yes.

18:59.953 --> 19:02.673
I always say our
hotel is like a big clock,

19:02.953 --> 19:04.953
and the employees are the cogs inside.

19:05.473 --> 19:08.393
We're pressed for time
and racing against time.

19:10.793 --> 19:12.793
People will always lose

19:14.793 --> 19:16.153
if they race against time.

19:18.713 --> 19:19.313
That's right.

19:19.313 --> 19:23.673
♫ Fall into the eyes secretly ♫

19:23.993 --> 19:29.033
♫ The world is like a quiet island ♫

19:32.673 --> 19:38.153
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

19:38.153 --> 19:39.153
Hongdou.

19:39.393 --> 19:41.673
What do you think we'll
look like when we grow old?

19:47.153 --> 19:48.792
The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

19:48.793 --> 19:52.953
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

19:53.753 --> 19:59.393
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

20:01.153 --> 20:05.033
♫ Go to a windy place to meet you ♫

20:05.033 --> 20:05.672
Yao.

20:05.673 --> 20:06.673
Yang Xu.

20:07.273 --> 20:08.273
Has your brother come home?

20:08.673 --> 20:09.673
No.

20:10.073 --> 20:11.192
Why don't you go find him?

20:11.193 --> 20:12.392
There's no need.

20:12.393 --> 20:14.233
When he gets bored,
he'll come back himself.

20:15.593 --> 20:17.273
Kids are not sensible at this age.

20:18.873 --> 20:20.473
How's your business?

20:21.273 --> 20:22.912
There are more drivers than tourists.

20:22.913 --> 20:24.072
We've got only a few customers.

20:24.073 --> 20:26.513
I'm planning to quit,
and take out a loan to buy a car.

20:26.753 --> 20:27.753
Buy a car?

20:28.433 --> 20:29.753
My cousin and his family are living in Kunming.

20:29.753 --> 20:30.952
I asked him about it.

20:30.953 --> 20:33.672
I'll be a driver there and my
wife will do housekeeping.

20:33.673 --> 20:34.233
When we make some money,

20:34.233 --> 20:35.833
we'll find a school and take our child there.

20:36.353 --> 20:39.513
So Tuotuo will be living
with his grandparents here?

20:40.073 --> 20:40.792
Yeah.

20:40.793 --> 20:41.593
There's nothing we can do.

20:41.593 --> 20:42.593
We can't make any money.

20:43.353 --> 20:45.032
It'll be all right.

20:45.033 --> 20:46.553
The government is developing
the tourist industry...

20:47.273 --> 20:48.833
Who knows what will happen?

20:52.313 --> 20:53.753
We'll come back when things get better.

20:54.033 --> 20:56.072
Now we need to provide for the family,

20:56.073 --> 20:57.433
and Tuotuo's going to elementary school,

20:57.433 --> 20:59.153
we can't always live off the farmland.

21:00.513 --> 21:02.313
I should go and look
for some customers.

21:15.753 --> 21:16.793
Qin.

21:17.953 --> 21:18.913
I'll have two light bulbs.

21:18.913 --> 21:20.112
12w, yellow light.

21:20.113 --> 21:21.153
Alright.

21:25.673 --> 21:27.313
I heard the reason why Yuan didn't go to school

21:27.313 --> 21:27.953
was because he had a stomachache

21:27.953 --> 21:29.352
and pooped his teacher's pants?

21:29.353 --> 21:31.233
How did he do that?

21:31.953 --> 21:33.472
Who did you hear it from?

21:33.473 --> 21:34.552
My mom.

21:34.553 --> 21:36.153
She heard it from someone else.

21:36.393 --> 21:38.392
Other said he pooped
at the school gate.

21:38.393 --> 21:39.472
I don't buy it.

21:39.473 --> 21:41.792
So you buy it that he
pooped his teacher's pants?

21:41.793 --> 21:43.353
Whose pants did he poop?

21:43.753 --> 21:44.553
He was the one who had the stomachache.

21:44.553 --> 21:45.993
What do you think?

21:46.273 --> 21:47.512
I don't know.

21:47.513 --> 21:49.873
I asked you on WeChat,
but you didn't reply to my message.

21:50.233 --> 21:51.233
Here.

21:52.273 --> 21:52.993
Tell me first.

21:52.993 --> 21:54.672
Whose pants did he poop?

21:54.673 --> 21:55.953
Give it to me.

21:57.633 --> 21:59.152
I'd like to go to your place for dinner tonight.

21:59.153 --> 22:01.433
That beef you braised
with wine is delicious.

22:02.633 --> 22:05.833
Your dad came to see me
yesterday and talked about you.

22:06.513 --> 22:07.833
Did he propose marriage?

22:08.433 --> 22:09.233
He wanted me to get you

22:09.233 --> 22:10.753
to work at the embroidery workshop as an apprentice.

22:11.353 --> 22:12.272
I'm not going.

22:12.273 --> 22:13.432
Even you can't persuade me.

22:13.433 --> 22:15.033
Tell him to forget it.

22:16.713 --> 22:19.073
Your dad just wants you to learn a trade.

22:19.393 --> 22:20.553
When I was a child, I watched my grandma

22:20.553 --> 22:22.192
embroider things all the time.

22:22.193 --> 22:23.752
A piece of clothing took her half a year.

22:23.753 --> 22:25.313
She almost became blind

22:25.313 --> 22:26.552
and couldn't even straighten her back.

22:26.553 --> 22:28.552
And she only made little money.

22:28.553 --> 22:29.553
I'm not going.

22:30.033 --> 22:31.192
Look at you.

22:31.193 --> 22:31.913
40 yuan for the two bulbs.

22:31.913 --> 22:32.753
Make a WeChat transfer.

22:32.753 --> 22:33.913
I'm selling you at cost.

22:47.033 --> 22:48.473
OK, try it.

22:51.673 --> 22:52.473
Sorry.

22:52.473 --> 22:53.952
It took me so long to change it.

22:53.953 --> 22:54.433
It's fine.

22:54.433 --> 22:55.992
I haven't started to cook yet.

22:55.993 --> 22:57.352
What else is broken?

22:57.353 --> 22:58.312
The one on the terrace.

22:58.313 --> 22:59.113
It's been broken for days.

22:59.113 --> 23:00.552
Nana is waiting for you upstairs.

23:00.553 --> 23:01.432
OK, I'll go check it.

23:01.433 --> 23:02.352
Thank you.

23:02.353 --> 23:03.353
You're welcome.

23:05.953 --> 23:07.512
I bought tomatoes.

23:07.513 --> 23:09.513
Let's have tomato and egg noodles tonight.

23:09.513 --> 23:10.993
It's easier to cook.

23:11.793 --> 23:12.993
Hongdou, what are you looking at?

23:14.473 --> 23:17.113
Mr. Xie hasn't gone to look for his brother?

23:17.833 --> 23:19.673
He doesn't know where to look for him.

23:20.153 --> 23:21.953
I don't think he cares.

23:22.473 --> 23:24.552
Maybe he really doesn't care.

23:24.553 --> 23:26.633
Nana told me that
Mr. Xie and his brother

23:26.633 --> 23:28.033
don't share the same mother.

23:29.513 --> 23:31.633
When Mr. Xie was very young,

23:31.633 --> 23:35.553
his parents went to Kunming
to work and left him here alone.

23:35.553 --> 23:38.473
Then, his mom died of an illness,
His father remarried

23:38.473 --> 23:40.792
a few years later,
that's why he had this brother.

23:40.793 --> 23:43.153
They haven't ever lived together.

23:44.113 --> 23:47.393
People have to spend time
together to forge a bond.

23:49.833 --> 23:51.952
Deqing is like an old peacock,

23:51.953 --> 23:54.992
always displaying his tail
feathers wherever he is.

23:54.993 --> 23:57.233
Wasn't he like that when he was young?

23:57.873 --> 23:58.873
Hongdou.

23:59.753 --> 24:01.073
Is Yao with you?

24:01.073 --> 24:03.393
Yao's changing the light bulb.

24:04.553 --> 24:05.593
Yao.

24:06.473 --> 24:07.073
Come down.

24:07.073 --> 24:08.793
We need to talk to you.

24:09.033 --> 24:09.953
Wait until I change the light bulb.

24:09.953 --> 24:11.072
It won't be long.

24:11.073 --> 24:11.913
Let's wait a while.

24:11.913 --> 24:13.233
We're not in a hurry anyway.

24:15.033 --> 24:16.112
Hongdou.

24:16.113 --> 24:17.353
Let me introduce.

24:17.353 --> 24:18.673
This is Auntie Feng.

24:19.313 --> 24:20.393
Auntie Feng.

24:21.073 --> 24:22.952
Come on, let's wait for him.

24:22.953 --> 24:23.633
Have a seat.

24:23.633 --> 24:25.352
I'll go make you some tea.

24:25.353 --> 24:27.312
No trouble, I'm not thirsty.

24:27.313 --> 24:29.433
What about me? I'm thirsty.

24:30.313 --> 24:32.032
Thanks, Hongdou.

24:32.033 --> 24:33.032
You're welcome.

24:33.033 --> 24:36.153
Yao's still in the mood to change the light bulb.

24:36.833 --> 24:38.113
What's your hurry?

24:38.113 --> 24:40.593
You're like a cockerel that swallowed gunpowder.

24:41.993 --> 24:43.992
Why are Aunt Baoping
and the others here?

24:43.993 --> 24:44.633
I don't know.

24:44.633 --> 24:46.033
They said they need to talk to Mr. Xie.

24:46.673 --> 24:48.753
These are communal cups?

24:49.113 --> 24:51.113
Mr. Ma bought
this for us to drink.

24:51.113 --> 24:52.473
Use it to make tea.

24:54.433 --> 24:56.313
That Auntie Feng looks serious.

24:56.313 --> 24:57.393
Who is she?

24:58.153 --> 25:00.473
Like Aunt Baoping,
Auntie Feng works

25:00.473 --> 25:01.712
in Mr. Xie's online shop.

25:01.713 --> 25:03.273
Aunt Baoping is responsible for delivery,

25:03.273 --> 25:04.913
and Auntie Feng is in charge of customer service.

25:05.233 --> 25:06.593
Mr. Xie's online shop?

25:06.833 --> 25:08.393
Isn't that Xiaochun's shop?

25:08.953 --> 25:12.913
Xiaochun's the
manager hired by Mr. Xie.

25:14.073 --> 25:16.353
So it means Xiaochun
only owns the coffee shop.

25:16.953 --> 25:19.832
I said that Xiaochun's
the manager.

25:19.833 --> 25:21.193
We all call him President Xie, don't we?

25:21.193 --> 25:22.592
Sometimes you call him that, too.

25:22.593 --> 25:24.952
That's because he's the
boss of the horse ranch.

25:24.953 --> 25:26.913
He owns the horse ranch,

25:27.233 --> 25:29.473
and also the embroidery workshop,
tie-dye workshop

25:29.473 --> 25:30.873
and this yard.

25:32.433 --> 25:33.593
You don't usually go out.

25:33.593 --> 25:35.233
How do you know so much about him?

25:37.633 --> 25:39.993
When I'm cooking, Nana always

25:39.993 --> 25:41.833
tells me gossip in the village.

25:42.873 --> 25:44.393
There's gossip here?

25:45.473 --> 25:46.553
A lot.

25:49.393 --> 25:50.473
Gossip.

25:52.033 --> 25:52.833
Have some fruit.

25:52.833 --> 25:53.473
Hongdou.

25:53.473 --> 25:54.113
There's the fruit?

25:54.113 --> 25:55.273
Come on, Hongdou, sit here.

25:55.873 --> 25:56.433
Sit here.

25:56.433 --> 25:57.392
Thank you.

25:57.393 --> 26:00.272
I don't believe she's already 30.

26:00.273 --> 26:00.793
I am.

26:00.793 --> 26:02.513
I'm two years older than Xiaochun.

26:02.913 --> 26:03.872
You don't look 30.

26:03.873 --> 26:05.232
You look young.

26:05.233 --> 26:07.152
When we were young,

26:07.153 --> 26:09.513
we had to pick fungus on Cangshan Mountain,

26:09.513 --> 26:11.473
and go fishing in Erhai Lake.

26:11.473 --> 26:15.032
Exposed to sun and wind,
we didn't care to apply cream,

26:15.033 --> 26:17.152
so we all look old.

26:17.153 --> 26:19.752
But our Xi is different.

26:19.753 --> 26:22.752
She's also 30,
but she has such tender skin.

26:22.753 --> 26:24.393
You look very much like her.

26:24.993 --> 26:25.993
Humph.

26:26.993 --> 26:28.152
What was that?

26:28.153 --> 26:29.593
What are you talking about?

26:29.953 --> 26:32.353
I said Hongdou looks like Xi.

26:32.353 --> 26:33.432
And you humphed.

26:33.433 --> 26:35.192
What's wrong with Xi?

26:35.193 --> 26:37.153
Nothing's wrong with Xi.

26:37.153 --> 26:38.512
Of course.

26:38.513 --> 26:40.113
Look at her hand.

26:40.713 --> 26:42.272
So delicate.

26:42.273 --> 26:44.193
I'm sure she hasn't done any rough work.

26:45.753 --> 26:46.753
How nice.

26:47.473 --> 26:49.473
Look, when you put your fingers together,
it looks tight.

26:49.473 --> 26:50.753
That means you can keep the money.

26:51.793 --> 26:53.832
Baoping is good at palmistry.

26:53.833 --> 26:56.033
She studied my son Yang's palm,

26:56.033 --> 26:58.352
and said he'd achieve the highest score on exams.

26:58.353 --> 27:00.553
Sure enough, he's very good at studies.

27:00.873 --> 27:01.873
What else?

27:03.033 --> 27:04.713
The love line is good.

27:04.713 --> 27:05.713
Good, good.

27:06.433 --> 27:08.953
I know she's a lucky girl.

27:10.233 --> 27:12.392
You only say nice things.

27:12.393 --> 27:13.873
What else to say?

27:13.873 --> 27:16.193
Reach out your hand and
let Baoping read your palm.

27:16.193 --> 27:17.712
What for?

27:17.713 --> 27:18.873
What century it is now?

27:18.873 --> 27:20.193
I don't believe in this.

27:20.833 --> 27:22.112
I'm coming.

27:22.113 --> 27:23.273
Come, have a seat.

27:23.913 --> 27:24.913
No.

27:25.033 --> 27:26.193
What do you want to tell me?

27:26.193 --> 27:27.793
Why don't you give me a call?

27:28.433 --> 27:29.913
We have to say it to your face.

27:29.913 --> 27:32.953
Don't think that we're annoying.

27:33.513 --> 27:36.273
We have to have a good talk today.

27:36.633 --> 27:37.873
You guys talk, I should...

27:37.873 --> 27:38.833
Hongdou, sit down.

27:38.833 --> 27:39.393
Sit down.

27:39.393 --> 27:40.793
We're going to talk about Yuan.

27:40.793 --> 27:42.672
You should listen, too.

27:42.673 --> 27:43.673
Eat some strawberries.

27:44.673 --> 27:46.993
These days,
everyone has been asking me about this.

27:46.993 --> 27:48.393
My mouth got dry with the talking.

27:48.953 --> 27:49.913
He's a grown-up already.

27:49.913 --> 27:51.392
What could happen to him?

27:51.393 --> 27:52.953
I know what I'm doing, alright?

27:53.273 --> 27:54.593
You don't.

27:55.233 --> 27:57.632
Yuan is still a little kid.

27:57.633 --> 28:00.473
We don't know how he's doing now.

28:00.793 --> 28:02.033
He's been away for a long time,

28:02.033 --> 28:03.713
and you didn't even look for him.

28:04.393 --> 28:06.352
Probably he doesn't know where to find him.

28:06.353 --> 28:08.913
But at least he should try to find him.

28:09.153 --> 28:11.473
If you don't even try it,
how will people in the village

28:11.473 --> 28:12.512
talk about you behind your back?

28:12.513 --> 28:14.673
They didn't come from the same mother.

28:14.673 --> 28:17.032
Yao just doesn't care about him.

28:17.033 --> 28:19.553
Don't listen to their nonsense,
will you?

28:20.433 --> 28:23.353
I admit that it's nonsense,
and we don't need to hear them.

28:23.353 --> 28:24.993
But we can't keep their mouths shut.

28:24.993 --> 28:27.073
They can say whatever you want.

28:27.513 --> 28:31.512
You have to go find him,
and call the police if you have to.

28:31.513 --> 28:33.833
Just tie him up and
take him to Kunming.

28:35.673 --> 28:36.793
This kid is willful.

28:36.793 --> 28:40.152
He just had a stomachache
and embarrassed himself.

28:40.153 --> 28:41.393
How could he quit school?

28:41.393 --> 28:42.792
What's the big deal of it?

28:42.793 --> 28:45.192
You can't say that.

28:45.193 --> 28:48.072
He has high
self-esteem at this age,

28:48.073 --> 28:49.632
and he thinks it's a serious matter,

28:49.633 --> 28:50.713
but he shouldn't have quit school

28:50.713 --> 28:52.553
just because of this, right?

28:53.073 --> 28:54.272
This is not important.

28:54.273 --> 28:55.633
Now we can't even find him.

28:56.833 --> 28:57.313
I mean it.

28:57.313 --> 28:58.953
You have to spank him when he comes back.

28:59.753 --> 29:01.313
Granny doesn't let me spank him.

29:01.713 --> 29:02.873
Granny doesn't let you?

29:04.073 --> 29:05.593
She's partial.

29:06.833 --> 29:07.592
That's right.

29:07.593 --> 29:09.352
She's too old.

29:09.353 --> 29:11.872
Yuan is the youngest kid.

29:11.873 --> 29:13.113
True, we can't spank him.

29:14.193 --> 29:16.752
How did we get carried away?

29:16.753 --> 29:18.593
You still need to find him.

29:19.713 --> 29:21.673
I didn't say I wouldn't find him.

29:22.233 --> 29:24.473
Just stay out of this and leave it to me,
okay?

29:24.473 --> 29:26.193
We won't leave it to you.

29:26.193 --> 29:27.753
Alright, enough.

29:28.153 --> 29:29.873
It's enough that he knows.

29:30.313 --> 29:32.033
Have the fruit, come on.

29:34.073 --> 29:36.553
We don't know where Yuan went.

29:45.113 --> 29:46.072
Auntie.

29:46.073 --> 29:47.033
Take care on your way back.

29:47.033 --> 29:47.713
Watch your step.

29:47.713 --> 29:48.713
OK.

29:48.793 --> 29:52.753
Well,
I need to talk to Yao about business.

29:52.753 --> 29:54.153
You guys go back first.

29:54.153 --> 29:55.153
OK.

29:55.433 --> 29:55.993
We're leaving.

29:55.993 --> 29:56.993
We won't wait up.

29:57.313 --> 29:58.313
Take care.

30:01.073 --> 30:02.073
Auntie Feng.

30:02.233 --> 30:03.473
What do you want to tell me?

30:04.873 --> 30:06.433
It's not about business, actually.

30:06.433 --> 30:08.273
Well, Yao,
do you still remember?

30:08.273 --> 30:12.392
When you were around 15,
you stole a bird nest

30:12.393 --> 30:13.833
with Qiang and Guanjun.

30:14.993 --> 30:17.592
After you came back,
we hadn't boiled the bird eggs

30:17.593 --> 30:19.033
before the police and
people from the Forest Service

30:19.033 --> 30:20.753
came to us.

30:21.953 --> 30:22.392
No.

30:22.393 --> 30:24.353
That's under state protection.

30:24.353 --> 30:26.152
See? You're still laughing.

30:26.153 --> 30:28.233
You just don't know how the law works.

30:28.713 --> 30:30.153
Did you see how serious the result was?

30:30.673 --> 30:31.832
I know, I know.

30:31.833 --> 30:33.432
Go on, please.

30:33.433 --> 30:37.513
Look,
Yuan's the same age as you were.

30:37.513 --> 30:38.912
Exactly the same age.

30:38.913 --> 30:40.432
He doesn't know about the law

30:40.433 --> 30:41.273
and he doesn't listen to the adults.

30:41.273 --> 30:42.592
He's rebellious.

30:42.593 --> 30:44.952
If you keep spoiling him
and don't discipline him,

30:44.953 --> 30:47.113
he'll easily get into big trouble.

30:47.113 --> 30:48.193
Do you know that?

30:50.273 --> 30:51.273
Auntie Feng.

30:52.273 --> 30:53.473
I'll be honest with you.

30:54.313 --> 30:55.993
But you can't tell this to anyone else.

30:56.713 --> 30:57.713
OK.

31:07.353 --> 31:08.673
Welcome.

31:08.673 --> 31:09.673
Take care.

31:11.073 --> 31:12.273
Please come again.

31:16.313 --> 31:17.673
Your dishes are ready, please enjoy.

31:17.673 --> 31:18.833
OK, thank you.

31:19.993 --> 31:20.473
Waiter.

31:20.473 --> 31:21.872
A plate of matsutake dumplings, please.

31:21.873 --> 31:22.792
OK.

31:22.793 --> 31:23.353
Miss.

31:23.353 --> 31:24.873
Table 3 wants a plate
of matsutake dumplings.

31:24.873 --> 31:25.513
Alright.

31:25.513 --> 31:26.513
OK.

31:27.433 --> 31:28.033
Hurry and take the plates.

31:28.033 --> 31:28.633
We're out of cutlery.

31:28.633 --> 31:29.633
OK.

31:41.873 --> 31:43.032
Welcome.

31:43.033 --> 31:44.593
Welcome.

32:34.233 --> 32:37.393
[Xiaxia]

32:41.713 --> 32:42.913
Hello, Xiaxia.

32:46.873 --> 32:47.873
I am tired.

32:48.593 --> 32:50.393
But I can do whatever they do.

32:51.953 --> 32:52.912
I know.

32:52.913 --> 32:54.353
I'm not that delicate.

32:57.993 --> 32:58.993
Well,

32:59.073 --> 33:00.353
how are you all?

33:00.713 --> 33:01.713
We're good.

33:02.433 --> 33:03.872
Your granny goes to work every day,

33:03.873 --> 33:04.913
and your brother's busy, too.

33:05.913 --> 33:07.593
You didn't tell my brother

33:07.993 --> 33:09.273
that you contacted me, did you?

33:09.513 --> 33:10.152
I didn't.

33:10.153 --> 33:11.313
What do you think I am?

33:12.473 --> 33:13.873
So my brother

33:14.113 --> 33:15.353
didn't look for me?

33:15.753 --> 33:16.712
He didn't.

33:16.713 --> 33:18.073
He doesn't know you're working part-time.

33:18.593 --> 33:20.073
They all think that
you'll come back

33:20.073 --> 33:21.153
when you run out of money.

33:23.513 --> 33:25.033
Well, they are wrong.

33:26.073 --> 33:27.512
Just come back soon.

33:27.513 --> 33:28.952
I'm not going back.

33:28.953 --> 33:30.313
I have to go to school if I go back.

33:31.673 --> 33:33.273
You should go to school.

33:34.753 --> 33:36.433
Didn't your brother say
he'd change a school for you?

33:37.273 --> 33:38.353
Why have you changed?

33:38.353 --> 33:39.953
You supported me before.

33:41.273 --> 33:43.633
I didn't know you weren't going to school

33:43.633 --> 33:44.913
because you had diarrhea.

33:45.473 --> 33:47.073
I thought you weren't interested in it.

33:49.953 --> 33:50.953
All right.

33:51.353 --> 33:52.673
If you want to work, just do it.

33:53.953 --> 33:55.033
Xiaxia.

33:55.273 --> 33:57.432
You haven't gone to Shanghai?

33:57.433 --> 33:58.473
When are you going there?

33:59.473 --> 34:00.553
Soon, why do you ask?

34:02.553 --> 34:03.873
Can you take me with you?

34:04.433 --> 34:05.433
Why do you want to go?

34:06.153 --> 34:07.913
I haven't been to Shanghai.

34:08.393 --> 34:11.073
Forget it,
and focus on your part-time job.

34:11.873 --> 34:12.873
I gotta go.

34:16.113 --> 34:17.393
Who were you just talking to?

34:18.113 --> 34:19.273
Xiaxia.

34:21.873 --> 34:22.873
Xiaxia?

34:23.513 --> 34:24.713
What did he tell you?

34:24.993 --> 34:26.513
You don't seem very happy.

34:28.993 --> 34:30.512
My brother didn't look for me.

34:30.513 --> 34:32.033
He doesn't even care about me.

34:34.553 --> 34:36.513
So let them worry for some more days.

34:54.033 --> 34:55.033
Liang.

34:55.273 --> 34:58.193
Your family just let
you go out to work?

34:59.073 --> 35:00.793
They couldn't control me.

35:48.913 --> 35:51.713
When you arrive in Shanghai,
call us as soon as you land.

35:52.313 --> 35:55.592
When you see Kaiwen,
give him the dairy fans.

35:55.593 --> 35:57.433
If he doesn't know how to make it,
give me a video call

35:57.433 --> 35:58.433
and I'll tell him.

35:59.353 --> 36:01.193
Who'll take so much stuff to the plane?

36:01.913 --> 36:03.232
This is not much.

36:03.233 --> 36:05.353
Besides,
you just need to put them on the plane,

36:05.353 --> 36:06.512
you don't need to carry them.

36:06.513 --> 36:08.513
Someone will pick you up
as soon as you get off the plane.

36:10.993 --> 36:11.952
Look at you.

36:11.953 --> 36:12.832
It's fine, I got it.

36:12.833 --> 36:13.712
Remember.

36:13.713 --> 36:15.392
Don't keep causing people trouble.

36:15.393 --> 36:18.072
Treat him to dinner
after he receives you.

36:18.073 --> 36:18.593
I know.

36:18.593 --> 36:20.353
Can you stop babbling?

36:20.633 --> 36:22.352
Do you think I want to blabber?

36:22.353 --> 36:24.953
I'm telling you about the ways of the world.

36:29.793 --> 36:30.793
Auntie.

36:31.393 --> 36:32.633
Hai, it's you.

36:32.633 --> 36:33.233
I thought your brother would come.

36:33.233 --> 36:33.993
Don't be late.
I thought your brother would come.

36:33.993 --> 36:35.673
Someone chartered his car.
Don't be late.

36:35.673 --> 36:36.393
Don't be late.

36:36.393 --> 36:37.673
The plane leaves at a quarter past twelve.
Don't be late.

36:37.673 --> 36:38.553
Don't be late.

36:38.553 --> 36:39.873
Rest assured.

36:40.553 --> 36:41.873
You just put the dairy fans like this?

36:41.873 --> 36:42.873
You...

36:43.673 --> 36:45.153
Keep it well.

36:47.273 --> 36:48.312
Don't forget.

36:48.313 --> 36:52.553
Call me when you get to
the airport and when you land.

36:52.953 --> 36:54.512
Give me a call every day.

36:54.513 --> 36:55.432
OK.

36:55.433 --> 36:56.433
Bye.

36:57.593 --> 36:58.673
We're leaving, then.

36:59.153 --> 37:00.353
Drive safe.

37:17.813 --> 37:22.553
♫ Seeing a star and a rainbow ♫

37:23.153 --> 37:25.433
♫ every step on your journey ♫

37:27.633 --> 37:30.473
♫ We've missed and hugged each other ♫

37:31.073 --> 37:35.433
♫ There are breezes in some parts of the world ♫

37:35.913 --> 37:38.793
♫ and some touching moments ♫

37:40.913 --> 37:43.713
♫ Whose dream will be fulfilled ♫

37:44.553 --> 37:50.073
♫ In the street where rain or sunshine falls ♫

37:50.593 --> 37:57.513
♫ Say goodbye to the passing time ♫

37:57.913 --> 38:01.553
♫ Sometimes I need a beautiful smile ♫

38:02.913 --> 38:06.673
♫ Although the seasons go by ♫

38:07.353 --> 38:10.953
♫ I still love them as when I was young ♫

38:11.233 --> 38:14.913
♫ Sometimes I find I fall in love ♫

38:16.193 --> 38:19.713
♫ Make a little wish and pray ♫

38:20.473 --> 38:24.793
♫ Maybe things will go your way ♫

