Mr. Ma.

38:38.633 --> 38:39.633
Morning.

38:39.993 --> 38:40.993
Morning.

38:41.393 --> 38:43.353
You're going jogging?

38:43.753 --> 38:45.193
The more we move, the more we live.

38:46.033 --> 38:47.033
Not exactly.

38:47.593 --> 38:50.233
The more we hold static,
the more we live.

38:54.833 --> 38:55.833
Gotta go.

38:56.273 --> 38:59.153
♫ Say goodbye ♫

38:59.713 --> 39:00.432
Granny.

39:00.433 --> 39:01.433
I'm leaving.

39:02.393 --> 39:04.192
Why didn't you have breakfast?

39:04.193 --> 39:05.433
I'll have it on the way.

39:06.033 --> 39:07.313
Stop there.

39:08.753 --> 39:10.833
I've warmed it for you.

39:10.833 --> 39:12.353
It's warm. Drink it.

39:12.873 --> 39:13.712
And this.

39:13.713 --> 39:14.713
Take it.

39:15.513 --> 39:16.633
Eat it while you're hungry.

39:17.473 --> 39:18.513
I should go.

39:19.313 --> 39:20.313
OK.

39:20.513 --> 39:22.712
Did you fill up the tank?

39:22.713 --> 39:24.313
I did last night.

39:24.753 --> 39:26.073
Drive safe.

39:26.073 --> 39:27.672
I know. See you.

39:27.673 --> 39:28.673
Bye.

39:35.153 --> 39:36.032
Good morning.

39:36.033 --> 39:37.033
Morning.

39:38.473 --> 39:39.432
Going to work?

39:39.433 --> 39:40.473
I'm going to Shuhe.

39:40.473 --> 39:41.392
It's a bit far away.

39:41.393 --> 39:42.592
Are you jogging?

39:42.593 --> 39:43.673
I'm exercising.

39:43.993 --> 39:44.673
Good luck.

