Ying.

40:47.953 --> 40:49.432
Xiaxia hasn't come yet?

40:49.433 --> 40:50.993
He went to Shanghai.

40:51.393 --> 40:52.512
He left today?

40:52.513 --> 40:52.913
Yes.

40:52.913 --> 40:54.593
Didn't he tell you that?

40:58.313 --> 40:59.313
I forgot.

41:04.993 --> 41:06.272
By the way, Master Xie,

41:06.273 --> 41:08.513
Xiaxia left a letter for you on the table.

41:23.953 --> 41:24.953
Master.

41:25.233 --> 41:26.393
I went to Shanghai.

41:26.793 --> 41:29.233
Take care of yourself and
don't get angry all the time.

41:29.473 --> 41:30.672
You have high blood pressure

41:30.673 --> 41:32.192
but you wouldn't go for a checkup.

41:32.193 --> 41:34.073
If you get angry, you might burst a blood vessel.

41:34.513 --> 41:36.673
That way,
I'll have to come back and take care of you.

41:37.553 --> 41:39.913
I won't forget the
craft you taught me.

41:40.273 --> 41:42.753
After I make money,
I'll take good care of you.

41:43.473 --> 41:45.553
Your apprentice, Xie Xiaoxia.

41:46.473 --> 41:47.633
Only three lines.

41:48.313 --> 41:49.913
You call it a letter?

42:04.913 --> 42:05.913
Uncle.

42:06.273 --> 42:07.273
Morning.

42:08.153 --> 42:09.153
Morning.

42:09.833 --> 42:11.873
Do you know that my
brother went to Shuhe?

42:12.273 --> 42:13.273
What for?

42:14.513 --> 42:16.193
For helping with your business.

42:18.913 --> 42:20.073
Well, I'm gonna go get busy.

42:20.753 --> 42:21.753
Take care.

